  "zh": "# 今日AI与科技领域多项突破引发全球关注\n## AI 与科技\n- **Claude Opus 5.5 Performance Analysis**：最新版本在推理速度与成本上显著提升，引发开发者热议。\n- **GPT-6 Sol and Luna Introduction**：OpenAI 推出双子模型，声称在多模态任务上超越前代。\n- **GPT-6 Astra Breaks Enigma**：利用新模型成功破解自2005年未解的恩尼格玛密码，展示AI在密码学的潜力。\n## 行业动向\n- **FoxPro Revived After 2007 Death**：昔日数据库引擎在社区驱动下重新活跃，提醒技术遗产价值。\n- **WordPress Path Traversal Vulnerability Alert**：未授权路径遍历可导致条件性RCE，站点需及时更新。\n## 国际视野\n- **Hackers Claim Full FBI Employee Data Exposure**：自称入侵FBI并掌握所有人员信息，凸显政府网络安全风险。\n- **US Missile Strike on Iran School Linked to AI Overreliance**：五角大楼承认AI决策辅助导致误伤学校，引发伦理与军事AI使用争议。",
  "en": "# Today's AI breakthroughs spark global attention across sectors\n## AI & Tech\n- **Claude Opus 5.5 Performance Analysis**：Latest version boosts inference speed and cuts cost, igniting developer excitement.\n- **GPT-6 Sol and Luna Introduction**：OpenAI unveils twin models claiming superior multimodal performance over predecessors.\n- **GPT-6 Astra Breaks Enigma**：New model cracks a 2005-unsolved Enigma cipher, highlighting AI's cryptographic potential.\n## Industry Trends\n- **FoxPro Revived After 2007 Death**：Legacy database engine revived by community, reminding us of enduring tech value.\n- **WordPress Path Traversal Vulnerability Alert**：Unauthenticated path traversal could lead to conditional RCE; urgent patching advised.\n## International\n- **Hackers Claim Full FBI Employee Data Exposure**：Alleged FBI breach exposing all staff data underscores government cyber‑risk.\n- **US Missile Strike on Iran School Linked to AI Overreliance**：Pentagon admits AI‑assisted decision contributed to mistaken school strike, fueling AI‑ethics debate."
